  tallyThresholdDialogue: {fileID: 0}
  tallyThresholdValue: 0
  BarkList:
  - 'Slow down, the mountain isn''t going anywhere. Probably. '
  - 'I think you''re a little lower than you planned. '
  - 'Well, that certainly didn''t go as planned. But most things don''t. '
  - 'I think you were supposed to keep going up. '
  - 'I admire your determination! Your landing technique, less so. '
  - 'At least you''re getting to know the mountain. '
  - 'I see you''ve discovered a very efficient way down. '
  - Gravity seems just as committed as you are.
  - 'Keep trying. You''ll get it. '
